WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Today’s work is deliberate and bounded.

2
00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Open the task to see its steps and completion evidence.

3
00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Keep near-term priorities separate from today’s commitments.

4
00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Longer-horizon work has a place without crowding the immediate plan.

